# Build output — regenerated inside the container by `dotnet publish`.
# Shipping these as build context bloats it to ~9 GB (bin/obj across
# Application + Tests) and has crashed Docker Desktop on constrained disks.
**/bin/
**/obj/
# Literal-backslash junk dir occasionally created on Windows/CI.
**/bin\\Release/

# IDE / editor / OS cruft — never needed in the image.
.vs/
.idea/
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store

# Test artifacts / coverage.
**/TestResults/
**/*.trx
**/coverage*.xml
